OL,3,GNEWSAMan killed after tree hits car in
OL,4,AStorm Boelo
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 20s has died in north
OL,7,FLondon after a tree fell on the car he
OL,8,Fwas driving during Storm Boelo.
OL,10,FOn Sunday, the Metropolitan Police were
OL,11,Fcalled to Dollis Road in Finchley at
OL,12,Faround 12:40 GMT to reports a tree had
OL,13,Ffallen onto a moving car. The man was
OL,14,Fpronounced dead at the scene.
OL,16,FChief Inspector Guy Ellwood, from the
OL,17,FNorth West Command Unit, said: "This is
OL,18,Fa deeply tragic incident and our
OL,19,Fthoughts are with the loved ones of the
OL,20,Fyoung man who lost his life."
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
