OL,3,GNEWSAMan killed after tree hits car in
OL,4,AStorm Boelo
OL,5,
OL,6,FA London Ambulance Service spokesperson
OL,7,Fsaid it sent incident response
OL,8,Fofficers, paramedics from its hazardous
OL,9,Farea response team, and a trauma team
OL,10,Ffrom London's Air Ambulance to the
OL,11,Fscene.
